      "lastLine": 1516,
      "text": "    def load_newobj(self):\n        args = self.stack.pop()\n        cls = self.stack.pop()\n        obj = cls.__new__(cls, *args)\n        self.append(obj)\n    dispatch[NEWOBJ[0]] = load_newobj"
